@startuml
title M-CG 单据号生成模块关系

skinparam componentStyle rectangle

package "M1 基础档案 / 系统字典" as M1 {
  [货主编码] as OwnerCode
  [document_type 字典] as DocumentType
}

package "M-CG 编码生成" as MCG {
  [单据号规则管理] as RuleAdmin
  [单据号生成服务] as NumberService
  [no-gap 计数器] as Counter
  [生成记录 / 幂等记录] as Allocation
}

package "业务模块" as Business {
  [M2 入库] as M2
  [M4 出库] as M4
  [M3 库内业务] as M3
  [其他单据模块] as OtherModules
}

package "横向能力" as Platform {
  [H1 权限] as Auth
  [H2 审计] as Audit
  [PostgreSQL 事务] as DB
}

RuleAdmin --> Auth : 配置权限校验
RuleAdmin --> Audit : 规则变更审计
RuleAdmin --> DocumentType : 绑定单据类型
RuleAdmin --> OwnerCode : 读取货主编码

M2 --> NumberService : 创建单据时申请单据号
M4 --> NumberService : 创建单据时申请单据号
M3 --> NumberService : 创建单据时申请单据号
OtherModules --> NumberService : 创建单据时申请单据号

NumberService --> DocumentType : 校验启用 / 生效 / 作用域
NumberService --> OwnerCode : 取货主编码 token
NumberService --> Counter : 锁定并递增
NumberService --> Allocation : 写生成记录和幂等结果
NumberService --> Audit : 生成审计
Counter --> DB : 同事务行锁
Allocation --> DB : 同事务持久化

note right of NumberService
业务模块不得自行拼接单据号。
单据号统一由 M-CG 生成。
end note

note bottom of Counter
当前设计按用户确认采用全部 no-gap。
取消单据保留号码，状态置为作废或取消。
end note
@enduml
